DESCRIPTION:Craft + Museum exhibits · San Mateo\nhttps://ma.to/event/tran
 sforming-the-cube-workshop-2026-11-07\n\nTransforming the Cube is a two-d
 ay ceramics workshop with Bill Abright at Clayroom San Mateo\, running No
 vember 7 and 8. Students learn to make a variety of sculptural box forms 
 from the common beginning of a 4-inch cube\, and all levels are welcome. 
 Using a homemade tile cutter to cut six equal sides from a pre-prepared s
 lab\, participants assemble the sides into cubes with scratch and slip jo
 inery\,
